Subject: [PATCH v20 01/28] x86/cpufeatures: Add Intel-defined SGX feature bit
Date:   Wed, 17 Apr 2019 13:39:11 +0300
Message-Id: <20190417103938.7762-2-jarkko.sakkinen@linux.intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.19.1
In-Reply-To: <20190417103938.7762-1-jarkko.sakkinen@linux.intel.com>
References: <20190417103938.7762-1-jarkko.sakkinen@linux.intel.com>
